  "releaseNotes": "## 12.2.0\n\n### Changes\n- Markdown images now use the unified inline-image pipeline: `MarkdownImage`\n  derives from `RichImage` and renders through the shared image presenter, and\n  Markdown images snapshot as `ImageSnapshotNode` (carrying the URL as\n  `SourceUri`) so they round-trip through the unified serializers. Async URL\n  loading via `MarkdownImageLoader` (a style-injected extension point) is\n  preserved; `MarkdownImage`'s `ImageSource`/`ImageTitle`/`ImageLoader`\n  properties are unchanged. The internal `HtmlImage` render control and\n  `MarkdownImageData` record were removed, and the 2px `HtmlImage` theme margin\n  no longer applies.",
